{"id":"H5989","lemma":"עַמִּיהוּד","transliteration":"ammihud","sayIt":"am-mi-HUD","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ammihud","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Ephraim living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Num.1.10;\nson of: Ladan (H3936);\nfather of: Elishama (H0476)\n§ Ammihud = \"my kinsman is majesty\"\n1) an Ephraimite, father of Elishama, the chief of the tribe at the time of the exodus\n2) a Simeonite, father of Shemuel\n3) father of Pedahel, prince of the tribe of Naphtali\n4) father of king Talmai of Geshur\n5) a descendant of Judah through his son Pharez","glosses":["ammihud"],"count":10,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"num-1","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ammihud","kjv":"of Ammihud"}},{"chapterId":"num-2","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ammihud"}},{"chapterId":"num-7","v":48,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ammihud","kjv":"of Ammihud"}},{"chapterId":"num-7","v":53,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ammihud"}},{"chapterId":"num-10","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ammihud"}},{"chapterId":"num-34","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ammihud"}},{"chapterId":"num-34","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ammihud"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-13","v":37,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ammihud","kjv":"of Ammihud"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ammihud","kjv":"Ammihud"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-9","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ammihud","kjv":"of Ammihud"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Numbers 1:10","note":"Of the children of Joseph: of Ephraim: Elishama the son of Ammihud; of Manasseh: Gamaliel the son of Pedahzur.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Samuel 13:37","note":"But Absalom fled, and went to Talmai the son of Ammihur, king of Geshur. David mourned for his son every day.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 7:26","note":"Ladan his son, Ammihud his son, Elishama his son,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H5991","lemma":"עַמִּיחוּר","transliteration":"ammichur","gloss":"Ammihur"},{"id":"H0476","lemma":"אֱלִישָׁמָע","transliteration":"elishama","gloss":"Elishama"},{"id":"H